# el1011-q-sp (2026-10-11): flb config (LOFF=1, SYNTH_KEEP_MODULES lane) + RTREE=1 + a real floorplan. fla synthesised (lane kept, 26,156 um2 x 64) but floorplanned at util 1.082 (1,718,742 um2 instances in a 1,588,441 um2 core) with a ~780k-pin reset net from one rs flop (WNS -25.5 ns at u_emb.cred SETN); flb was submitted on the fpa kit (no LOFF) and re-stalled in flat SHARE. Outline 1555.2 x 2058.48 -> util ~0.54.
# qwen-1010/A (2026-10-10 23:00): fpb + LOFF=1.  The fpb route stalled > 1.5 h in yosys SHARE after FLATTEN: SYNTH_HIERARCHICAL with
# SYNTH_MINIMUM_KEEP_SIZE kept NO module (6.3 FLATTEN inlined every g_lane[*].u_lane), so it was the same ~22M-gate flat netlist.
# Root cause: the 64 lanes were 64 DISTINCT paramods (LANE = l only offsets 4 addresses).  LOFF=1 forms those offsets
# (cur + l x stride, the same AW-bit sums, 0 cycles) in ot_hdc_vstream and instantiates every lane with LANE 0, so all 64
# lanes are ONE module; SYNTH_KEEP_MODULES keeps it, so yosys/ABC synthesise one ~85k-gate lane once (64 instances).
# fe-push-qwen-1010 (2026-10-10): qfd_sp_su64_sfu_bv (bv_ea pin plan: issue / status on the E face) with RSRAM=1 -- the
# embedding row buffer (64 x 512 = 32,768 flops + a 64:1 x 512 read mux) is one ot_sram_1r1w_64x512_m1_r2c2 macro, same
# edges (write at eq_v, read at code_re, registered macro output = code_q; 0 cycles, Verilator bench exact vs RSRAM 0,
# row-off mutant FAILS) -- and ORFS hierarchical synthesis (SYNTH_HIERARCHICAL 1): every bv / bv_acc / s2 route since
# 10-07 died or stalled in a FLAT synthesis (bv_acc yosys -9 twice; bv_ea 4 h at 48 GB in the local flat pre-synth): the
# 64 lanes are distinct parameterisations (~85k generic gates each), a flat ABC over ~22M generic gates.  Per-module
# synthesis runs in minutes.  STAGES=pnr (the macro view forces it; no local flat pre-synth).  Variant b: outline widened to 1,036.8 x 2,058.48 (sizing probe: ~6M cells, ~780k flops at SW 64 by a hierarchical yosys estimate).
TOP=ot_qfd_sp_su64_sfu_bv
SRCS='rtl/qwen_sys/vm_me_20261008/ot_qfd_su_master_bv.sv rtl/qwen_sys/rtl_finish_20261007/ot_qfd_su_master.sv rtl/qwen_sys/missing_masters_20261007/ot_qfd_spine_masters.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_qwen_int8_embed_decode.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_delay.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_fpu.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_fastfp.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_sfu.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_sfu_q.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_vstream_lane.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_vreduce.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_vstream.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_fp32_add_lat.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_prefix.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_fp32_mul_pipe.sv physical/asap7_memory_macros/ot_sram_1r1w_64x512_m1_r2c2/ot_sram_1r1w_64x512_m1_r2c2_bb.v'
PARAMS=(--param IS=1 --param OS=1 --param VL=7 --param RSRAM=1 --param LOFF=1 --param RTREE=1)
FW=1555.2
FH=2058.48
PINS=(--pin-region '^(clk|rst_n)$=left' --pin-region '^(crom_\w+|ea_\w+|eq_\w+|kv_\w+|wrom_fault)(\[|$)=left' --pin-region '^(i_\w+|go|a_src|tok|ready|idle|obs_\w+|progress|progress_rows|fault)(\[|$)=right' --pin-region '^(s_\w+|sw_\w+|red_\w+)(\[|$)=top')
INTER='*'
REFGLOB='*'
FALSE_FROM='rst_n'
PD=0.55
NC=16
MACROS=(physical/asap7_memory_macros/ot_sram_1r1w_64x512_m1_r2c2)
EXTRA=(--macro-view ot_sram_1r1w_64x512_m1_r2c2=physical/asap7_memory_macros/ot_sram_1r1w_64x512_m1_r2c2 --macro-place-halo 12.96 12.96 --orfs-var PDN_TCL=/src/physical/qwen_slab_m5/pdn_m5.tcl --orfs-var MACRO_PLACEMENT_TCL=/src/physical/qwen_die_masters/su64_rsram_place.tcl --orfs-var 'SYNTH_KEEP_MODULES=*ot_hdc_vstream_lane*')
STAGES=pnr
PIN_H='M4 M6'
PIN_V='M5 M7'
